Interpretation: if 'centre rel err' stops improving as h shrinks, you have
hit the systematic floor from finite wire thickness (a/R) and the tight
domain box -- not a discretization limit. Reduce --minor-radius to close
the first gap; the second needs a larger --air-padding (use >= 2*R).

